  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c04cfa2562ce81931b834c6b3e94677ee93eb144_0.webp\"></span></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Этот ресурспак заменяет всю музыку Minecraft на мрачную, атмосферную и напряжённую музыку.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Акцент сделан на более деликатные композиции с плавным нарастанием, а не на громкую дешёвую хоррор-музыку.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>Это наследник <span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Horror Ambience Music:</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Echoes</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>Фокусируется на атмосферной музыке в стиле <span style=\"color:#fff\">Silent Hill</span></strong></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.pixabay.com/photo/2021/09/11/18/21/youtube-6616310_1280.png\" width=\"60\" height=\"39\">Предпросмотр на YouTube</strong></h1>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/B2WFuBJBF44\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>&nbsp;Авторы музыки:</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ff2209\"><strong>Josh Lim:</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#731d15\"><strong>Туман</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#731d15\"><strong>Заблудшие души</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#731d15\"><strong>Без следа</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#731d15\"><strong>Дрейф</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#731d15\"><strong>Дом</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#731d15\"><strong>Шёпот</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#731d15\"><strong>Дальняя память</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#34e316\"><strong>CO.AG:</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#165b0a\"><strong>Потерянные</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0d9af8\"><strong>Void - Cult Ambient:</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#186192\"><strong>HOME</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#186192\"><strong>DREAM</strong></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Подписывайтесь на этих авторов в&nbsp;</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.pixabay.com/photo/2021/09/11/18/21/youtube-6616310_1280.png\" width=\"63\" height=\"41\">YouTube</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Посмотрите мои другие проекты!</strong></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gZbFxYdC/echoes-banner.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2bc82d\"><a style=\"color:#2bc82d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/horror-ambience-music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/horror-ambience-music</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2bc82d\"><a style=\"color:#2bc82d\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fhorror-ambience-music-echoes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://modrinth.com/datapack/horror-ambience-music-echoes</strong></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0jm08hxq/Untitled-design-2.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0d9af8\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0d9af8\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-music-remastered-streamer-friendly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-music-remastered-streamer-friendly</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0d9af8\"><a style=\"color:#0d9af8\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmusic-remastered-mmr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/music-remastered-mmr</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/r2KjjNCr/Untitled-design-1.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/primeval-music\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/primeval-music</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fprimeval-music\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/primeval-music</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>СПОНСОР</strong></h1>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0Mxx23C/Sponsor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">Получите скидку 15% на первый месяц у Kinetic Hosting по ссылке:<strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0ce5f7\"><a style=\"color:#0ce5f7\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=80\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=80</a>&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0ce5f7\"><strong>ПРОМОКОД: <span style=\"color:#fff\">Jrinc</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2_icon_clyde_blurple_RGB.png\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\"> DISCORD</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nJ7Ue6x8TC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/nJ7Ue6x8TC</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\">Вся музыка не имеет ограничений по авторским правам!</h6>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
